Z||000006||mrfiero||08-29-2000||11:40 AM||||The econo coupes have a taller gear ratio.....I think it's 3.32 (not sure).  The RPO code is MY8.  I own one of these coupes....v.it is the absolute basic Fiero....when GM advertised an '84 Fiero for $7999, this is the car they were talking about.  No power options at all, no sunroof, no luggage rack, no a/c, no tilt, base am radio....etc.  <P>Mine needs some clutch work, but runs fine (shows only 91K miles!).  I hope to have it fixed soon....I want to see what kind of mileage it really gets!||||reg||7
